Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanLaneFollowingWithYellowTaxi" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow taxi vehicle in right lane" .
:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Gray vehicle ahead in left lane" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Debris or object on road surface near front of ego vehicle" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Clear weather, daytime" .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision due to following distance" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Potential hazard from road debris" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:risk3 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Potential lane intrusion by gray vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.55"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.55"^^xsd:float .
```

